      "description": {
        "fun": "A ghost of powdered matcha living in a tea caddy, said to be born from the regrets of an old tea master who drove everyone away chasing the perfect tea ceremony. It sprinkles its powder on people and food; touch or taste it and your skin glows for a moment, then you pass out as it drains your life force. It looks just like Sinistea, but the two aren't related at all.",
        "guide": "A Grass and Ghost-type Pokémon introduced in The Teal Mask, made of matcha powder living in a tea caddy. It looks like Sinistea but is an unrelated species. It comes in Counterfeit and Artisan Forms, told apart only by a stamp on the caddy's base.",
