      },
      "branches": {
        "text": "Its form decides. A Counterfeit Form Poltchageist, with no stamp on its caddy, needs an Unremarkable Teacup and becomes Unremarkable Form Sinistcha; an Artisan Form, stamped as genuine, needs a Masterpiece Teacup and becomes Masterpiece Form Sinistcha.",
