        "fun": "A bowl of matcha come to life, with a tea whisk on its head that it stirs itself with to build up energy for battle. It used to sneak into homes pretending to be tea so people would drink it and lose their life force, but the kind of bowl it lives in fell out of use and the trick rarely works now. The mended cracks on its bowl echo kintsugi, pottery repaired with gold.",
